## API Selection Matrix

| Problem | ❌ Legacy | ✅ Modern |
|---------|----------|----------|
| Loading state | `useState + useEffect(fetch)` | `Suspense + use()` |
| Optimistic UI | `useState + try/catch + rollback` | `useOptimistic + startTransition` |
| Non-blocking updates | `useState + debounce` | `useTransition` / `useDeferredValue` |
| Form pending state | `useState(isPending)` | `useFormStatus` / `useActionState` |
| State preservation | `{isOpen && <Modal />}` | `<Activity mode={...}>` |
| Effect with latest props | `useEffect + useRef` | `useEffectEvent` |
| External subscriptions | `useEffect + cleanup` | `useSyncExternalStore` |
| Complex conditionals | if/else chains | `match().with().exhaustive()` |

