## Custom Hook Extraction

| Signal | Action |
|--------|--------|
| 3+ useState in component | Extract to `useXxxState` hook |
| useEffect with subscription | Extract using `useSyncExternalStore` |
| Form with validation | Extract to `useXxxForm` with `useActionState` |
| Modal/dialog state | Extract to `useXxxDialog` hook |
| Same logic in 2+ components | Consolidate to shared hook |

```tsx
// ❌ God Component with scattered state
function BoardPage() {
  const [isSettingsOpen, setIsSettingsOpen] = useState(false)
  const [settingsTab, setSettingsTab] = useState('general')
  const [isModalOpen, setIsModalOpen] = useState(false)
  const [modalData, setModalData] = useState(null)
  const [isPending, setIsPending] = useState(false)
}

// ✅ Focused custom hooks
function BoardPage() {
  const settings = useBoardSettings()
  const modal = useProjectModal()
  // Component focuses on rendering, not state orchestration
}
```

