## Form Actions (React 19+)

```tsx
<form action={async (formData) => { 'use server'; await save(formData) }}>
  <input name="email" />
  <SubmitButton /> {/* useFormStatus inside */}
</form>
```

**Note**: `useFormStatus` must be called from a CHILD component of `<form>`, not the same component.

