## React 19 Syntax Updates

| Pattern | ❌ Old | ✅ New |
|---------|--------|--------|
| forwardRef | `forwardRef((props, ref) => ...)` | `function Input({ ref, ...props })` |
| Context Provider | `<Ctx.Provider value={...}>` | `<Ctx value={...}>` |
| Ref cleanup | — | `ref={(node) => { setup(); return cleanup }}` |
| Document metadata | `<Head>` (Next.js) | `<title>`, `<meta>` anywhere in tree |

